t sieben Ferienwohnungen und zehn Stellplätzen entstehen. Ob das Vorhaben umgesetzt werden kann, ist unklar, da auf dem Grundstück eine Fledermauskolonie entdeckt wurde und die Regenentwässerung noch nicht geklärt ist</div></div><div class="tw:flex tw:pb-xs tw:@[828px]:pb-0 tw:@[828px]:pr-md tw:@[828px]:w-[118px] tw:@[1100px]:w-[310px]"><div class="craft-codes tw:flex tw:overflow-hidden tw:flex-wrap tw:@[828px]:flex-wrap tw:gap-2xs tw:@[828px]:gap-xs tw:h-[24px] tw:@[828px]:h-fit tw:w-full tw:z-50" data-controller="craft-codes"><a href="/auftraege/auftrag-suchen?search%5Bcraft_code_ids%5D%5B%5D=292&search%5Bfederal_states%5D%5B%5D=Mecklenburg-Vorpommern&search%5Binclude_archived%5D=false&search%5Binclude_discarded%5D=false&search%5Binclude_remembered%5D=true&search%5Binclude_viewed%5D=true&search%5Bper_page%5D=10&search%5Bquery_operator%5D=and&search%5Bregion_type%5D=federal_states&search%5Bsort_order%5D=best&search%5Buse_additional_procedure_stadiums%5D=false" class="badge-link-container tw:cursor-pointer tw:w-fit tw:outline-0"><span class="tw:whitespace-nowrap basic-badge badges-brand-light-linked craft-code tw:truncate tw:inline-block! tw:leading-(--tw-spacing-lg)! tw:max-w-[calc(100%_-_52px)] tw:@[568px]:max-w-full" data-controller="tooltip" data-tooltip-text-value="Baumeisterarbeiten" data-action="mouseenter->tooltip#show mouseleave->tooltip#hide focusin->tooltip#show focusout->tooltip#hide">Baumeisterarbeiten</span></a><a href="/auftraege/auftrag-suchen?search%5Bcraft_code_ids%5D%5B%5D=290&search%5Bfederal_states%5D%5B%5D=Mecklenburg-Vorpommern&search%5Binclude_archived%5D=false&search%5Binclude_discarded%5D=false&search%5Binclude_remembered%5D=true&search%5Binclude_viewed%5D=true&search%5Bper_page%5D=10&search%5Bquery_operator%5D=and&search%5Bregion_type%5D=federal_states&search%5Bsort_order%5D=best&search%5Buse_additional_procedure_stadiums%5D=false" class="badge-link-container tw:cursor-pointer tw:w-fit tw:outline-0"><span class="tw:whitespace-nowrap basic-